{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1063.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"f6669016032f3424fb8465455c9cc403edcbc7d409f205d33a0e1358ed7d5dd9","ja":"イーサンの演技をしたら\n小さい子を泣かせちゃったの……。","zh":"我一演伊森，\n就把小孩子给弄哭了……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1063.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"57b9e00bb43fe744bc66775a9e7db7fd9c916faa018b00f55ec26295f864c17a","ja":"せっかく来てくれたのに……。","zh":"难得都特意过来了……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1063.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"1754e87390b6e096eb98a80fb2c129905b9e537d3154538f3e56e01b5b470810","ja":"そっか、そんなことが……。","zh":"这样啊，原来还有这种事……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1063.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"c23c3908dac780c20014ba26b4cb7c0abfcd084b6400d9c7d9a56f112a94cc89","ja":"えっと……た、大変、だったね……。で、でも……\n育ちゃんが、嫌われちゃったわけじゃないし……。","zh":"那个……真、真不容易啊……但、但是……\n小育并不是被讨厌了啊……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1063.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"04c26c68f7283ab456e3d659da89355e85f64950c8eace6f1eaf97155656564a","ja":"うん、気にすることないって思うな。\nその子はきっと、育の演技に圧倒されただけなの。","zh":"嗯，我觉得没必要放在心上啦。\n那个孩子肯定只是被育的演技震慑住了而已。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1063.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"907bd4088de3b321fde1b4ebee883084ced915efb75bd7fc032539111081ae81","ja":"そうですね。それに、怖がられるなんて……\nヴィランとしては、誇らしいことなんじゃない？","zh":"也是呢。而且，被人害怕……\n作为反派，不正是值得自豪的事吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1063.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"6741820e1cfd8f9a623d7b38df0948afb9266157c21f2ba1f089d9a730d5207e","ja":"えっ……ほこらしいの……？","zh":"诶……很自豪吗……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1063.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"dcfcb281d2ba42a01939de263ae27093dcde74656d631f70611530be090c6ebe","ja":"確かに！　育がそれだけ、凄みのある\nマフィアのボスになれてたってことだもんね！","zh":"确实呢！说明育已经能够演得那么有\n黑帮老大的威慑力了嘛！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1063.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"fc4775510842667e5a99b6d9eced504e056b3c533a1b1c948aacdfa6f9708211","ja":"思わず泣いちゃうほど怖い……\nそんな演技ができたなんて、育はすごいよ！","zh":"害怕得让人忍不住想哭……\n能演得这么逼真，育好厉害啊！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1063.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"d92fd1afa58474a639cdbf149e51f8db75e072c8f81f67997e2f69563cd95613","ja":"で、でも……小さい子を泣かせちゃうのって、\nよくないんじゃ……？","zh":"但、但是……把小孩子弄哭，\n是不是不太好呀……？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1063.unity3d","item_key":"commands[30].text","source_sha256":"8fbad6e814e3fe4f58b74eb728f054fb21d2cfbf724cc4c38f008b8955034ee8","ja":"そんなことないよ。\nだってそれも、あの劇の魅力だから！","zh":"才没有那回事呢。\n因为那也是那部剧的魅力所在啊！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1063.unity3d","item_key":"commands[31].text","source_sha256":"d1aaa5dd2b66e7f98860e219658dd98ad55a567663fbfa951668972c842a802d","ja":"怖い人が出てくることで、\n物語がすっごく盛り上がることあるんだからさ！","zh":"因为有了可怕的人出场，\n故事才会有超级精彩的时候呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1063.unity3d","item_key":"commands[32].text","source_sha256":"30f01a05a17fe8dfd2a5a8d8d03bb4db6c41166278867229e7ba0a363a083042","ja":"そっか……。魔法少女の敵も、怖がられたり\nするけど……それだけじゃないし……！","zh":"原来是这样……魔法少女的敌人虽然也会被\n大家害怕……但也不仅仅是那样……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T13:52:32+00:00"}
